  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">La tarde de este s&aacute;bado, ha actuado en la explanada adjunta al Caf&eacute; Colonial de Onda el grupo Zambra Flamenca, ante numeros&iacute;simo p&uacute;blico, que ha sabido esperar al restraso provocado por el partido de f&uacute;tbol.</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/05/IMG_0559.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Con la formaci&oacute;n habitual de Jes&uacute;s de Vicente, La Meligrana y Jordi Blasco ha colaborado en esta actuaci&oacute;n H&eacute;ctor Madue&ntilde;o Pallar&eacute;s. Tambi&eacute;n han pariticpado Mioara Ahicart, un chico y una chica a quienes Jes&uacute;s de Vicente ense&ntilde;a guitarra, y &Oacute;scar G&oacute;mez Edo con su flauta travesera al final de cada parte.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0558.jpg\" alt=\"img_0558\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0559.jpg\" alt=\"img_0559\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0560.jpg\" alt=\"img_0560\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0561.jpg\" alt=\"img_0561\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0562.jpg\" alt=\"img_0562\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0563.jpg\" alt=\"img_0563\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0564.jpg\" alt=\"img_0564\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0565.jpg\" alt=\"img_0565\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0566.jpg\" alt=\"img_0566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0567.jpg\" alt=\"img_0567\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0568.jpg\" alt=\"img_0568\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0569.jpg\" alt=\"img_0569\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0570.jpg\" alt=\"img_0570\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0571.jpg\" alt=\"img_0571\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0572.jpg\" alt=\"img_0572\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0573.jpg\" alt=\"img_0573\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/zambraflamencacolonialonda170514/img_0574.jpg\" alt=\"img_0574\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439ef